## The pipeline itself is working

The second pull proves every link downstream of attestation: members who completed attestation between 23 Aug and 2 Sep each got an `attestation_expiry_update` audit row with `pending_expires_at = 1 Sep 2027`, and the programmer account building@ (0abc55a0) ran `confirm_programming` on 21 credentials on 3 Sep between 12:08 and 12:59 AEST, each promoting the expiry and reactivating the fob. Those members' fobs now read `active` to 31 Aug 2027 with the flag cleared. So Dinah's absence is purely upstream: nothing was ever staged for her.

